o<m108_remap> sub
; M108 — retract the Marposs touch probe. De-energizes digital-out-12.
; Always call this after probing, before resuming normal cutting motion —
; the deployed probe sits close enough to the spindle to be a crash risk if
; left extended, and nothing else in this config retracts it automatically.
; See README.md "Workpiece Touch Probe (Marposs)".
M65 P12
G4 P0.5
o<m108_remap> endsub
